WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:03.236
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show,"
everyone.

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:04.671
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:06.039
Here we are.

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:07.974
Let's get to the news and jokes,
everybody.

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:09.943
Well guys, I saw
that former presidents

00:00:09.943 --> 00:00:13.279
Barack Obama, George W. Bush,
and Bill Clinton

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:16.015
want to encourage Americans
to get the COVID vaccine

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:18.784
by getting theirs on camera.

00:00:18.784 --> 00:00:21.487
President Trump wanted to be
included, but Obama said,

00:00:21.487 --> 00:00:24.056
"Uh, sorry, pal, but it's
two-termers only."

00:00:24.056 --> 00:00:26.191
[ Laughter ]
-Ooh!

00:00:26.191 --> 00:00:29.362
Ooh!
Ooh!

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:31.230
[ Applause ]

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:33.933
-Meanwhile, 96-year-Old
Jimmy Carter is like,

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:37.403
"Uh, hello? Anybody want
to give me a vaccine?

00:00:37.403 --> 00:00:39.238
[ Laughter ]
You guys go ahead.

00:00:39.238 --> 00:00:40.907
I'll wait in line at CVS."

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:42.308
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:44.410
It would be great if they got
the vaccine together.

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:46.645
After Bush and Clinton, Obama's
going to roll up his sleeve

00:00:46.645 --> 00:00:48.848
like, "Welcome to the gun show.

00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:51.718
Ah, right, boys?"

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:53.719
I love this idea.
It's just like when Hoover,

00:00:53.719 --> 00:00:56.523
F.D.R., and Truman all got
prostate exams over the radio.

00:00:56.523 --> 00:01:00.660
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:02.762
Here's some news about the fight
against COVID.

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:05.631
Dr. Fauci said that
he's not leaving his job,

00:01:05.631 --> 00:01:07.367
and today he had
his first official meeting

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:09.502
with Biden's team over Zoom.

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:11.637
Fauci said it was nice
to kick off a meeting

00:01:11.637 --> 00:01:13.806
without the president
booing him.

00:01:13.806 --> 00:01:15.241
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:17.777
Meanwhile, the president still
won't concede the election.

00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:20.913
And yesterday in Michigan --
did you see this?

00:01:20.913 --> 00:01:23.750
Rudy Giuliani called
a star witness...

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.617
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.617 --> 00:01:29.088
...in front of the committee
to discuss voter fraud.

00:01:29.088 --> 00:01:31.924
Let's see how that went,
and let's meet this...

00:01:31.924 --> 00:01:33.859
-If the --
-Guess how many, wait.

00:01:33.859 --> 00:01:36.963
What about, what about, what
about the turnout rate?

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:38.964
120%?

00:01:38.964 --> 00:01:41.701
-We're not seeing the poll book
off by 30,000 votes.

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:43.469
That's not the case.
-What did you guys do,

00:01:43.469 --> 00:01:46.805
take it and do something
crazy to it?

00:01:46.805 --> 00:01:49.309
I know what I saw,
and I signed something

00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:53.145
saying that if I'm wrong,
I can go to prison.

00:01:53.145 --> 00:01:54.213
Did you?

00:01:54.213 --> 00:01:55.748
[ Laughter ]
-Whew!

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:57.550
-Yo!
-Oh, my --

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:58.952
-Yo!

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:01.854
-Once again, that was
their star witness.

00:02:01.854 --> 00:02:04.657
Where does Rudy keep finding
these people?

00:02:04.657 --> 00:02:06.092
Linkedin-sane?

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:09.228
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.228 --> 00:02:11.597
It was clear she forgot where
she was when she was like,

00:02:11.597 --> 00:02:13.766
[Slurring] "Waiter,
another tequila sunrise.

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:15.135
Um...
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:18.104
Because I'm drinking.
Did you have one?

00:02:18.104 --> 00:02:21.140
Because I'm the one
who had a drink.

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:24.743
Did you?
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.743 --> 00:02:26.813
Because I'm the one
who had one drink."

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:30.316
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:32.819
-Yeah.
-I mean, Rudy was so nervous,

00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:35.254
he started squirting black ink
like an octopus.

00:02:35.254 --> 00:02:39.491
It just --
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.491 --> 00:02:41.861
It's not a good sign when
Rudy Giuliani has to lean over

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:43.830
and go, "You're making
a fool of yourself."

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:45.731
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.731 --> 00:02:47.966
I don't know that woman,
but I can guarantee you

00:02:47.966 --> 00:02:50.170
her Uber rating is below
two stars.

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:52.839
You know what I'm saying?
Do you agree?

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:54.707
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:56.375
Rudy also talked at the event

00:02:56.375 --> 00:02:58.677
and a lot of people are saying
that they heard something

00:02:58.677 --> 00:02:59.979
while he was speaking.

00:02:59.979 --> 00:03:01.981
Now, I swear --
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:04.684
We did not do anything
to this clip, okay?

00:03:04.684 --> 00:03:06.252
[ Laughter ]
Just watch the clip

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:08.621
and listen closely,
see if you hear anything.

00:03:08.621 --> 00:03:11.357
-I will ask that he be
disciplined for that.

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:13.293
[ Fart ]
First of all, the answer

00:03:13.293 --> 00:03:15.361
I gave you is they didn't
bother to interview

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:17.029
a single witness.
[ Fart ]

00:03:17.029 --> 00:03:19.331
Just like you.

00:03:19.331 --> 00:03:20.400
-Yo.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:24.837
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:26.839
-Can we go one week
without something

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:28.473
leaking out of Rudy Giuliani?

00:03:28.473 --> 00:03:34.246
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:34.246 --> 00:03:37.716
Yep, we've had liquids
and now gas.

00:03:37.716 --> 00:03:39.618
God help us when a solid
comes out of him.

00:03:39.618 --> 00:03:41.688
I mean...
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.688 --> 00:03:45.024
He's like every gross guy on the
subway rolled into one human.

00:03:45.024 --> 00:03:47.526
[ Laughter ]

00:03:47.526 --> 00:03:49.195
It's actually
not what you think.

00:03:49.195 --> 00:03:51.431
The chair was just wet
from mucus and hair dye.

00:03:51.431 --> 00:03:56.101
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.101 --> 00:03:58.805
[ Snorts and smacks lips ]

00:03:58.805 --> 00:04:00.339
-Yeah.

00:04:00.339 --> 00:04:02.207
-Some more political news.

00:04:02.207 --> 00:04:04.610
I mean, I don't even know why
we do more monologue.

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:06.212
That's all you really --
-That's it.

00:04:06.212 --> 00:04:07.913
-That's it right there, yeah.

00:04:07.913 --> 00:04:09.382
Some more political news
this week.

00:04:09.382 --> 00:04:11.951
Attorney General William Barr
went against Trump and said

00:04:11.951 --> 00:04:14.320
there was no widespread
voter fraud,

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:16.222
and now Trump is
not so happy with him.

00:04:16.222 --> 00:04:17.257
Watch this.

00:04:19.692 --> 00:04:21.661
-Uh...

00:04:21.661 --> 00:04:25.965
Ask me that in a number
of weeks from now.

00:04:25.965 --> 00:04:29.035
[ Laughter ]

00:04:29.035 --> 00:04:30.770
-Which means by Sunday
Trump will be like,

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:32.472
"I think it's time
to free 'Willy.'"

00:04:32.472 --> 00:04:35.641
[ Laughter ]

00:04:35.641 --> 00:04:37.776
Barr is so fired,

00:04:37.776 --> 00:04:39.311
the only thing left
for Trump to decide

00:04:39.311 --> 00:04:41.214
is from which toilet
to tweet it from.

00:04:41.214 --> 00:04:42.782
[ Laughter ]

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:44.650
It's going to be awkward when
Trump says, "You're fired,"

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:47.019
and Barr is like,
"Dude, so are you!"

00:04:47.019 --> 00:04:49.222
[ Laughter ]

00:04:49.222 --> 00:04:51.157
Well, this is interesting.
I saw that

00:04:51.157 --> 00:04:53.058
President-elect Biden's
leading candidate

00:04:53.058 --> 00:04:55.861
for CIA director,
David S. Cohen,

00:04:55.861 --> 00:04:59.698
once appeared as an extra in an
episode of "Game of Thrones."

00:04:59.698 --> 00:05:01.467
Take a look at this.

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:03.335
Yeah, that's him.
-What?

00:05:03.335 --> 00:05:06.338
-Yeah, he might be
in charge of the CIA.

00:05:06.338 --> 00:05:08.508
Well, it turns out he's not the
only government official

00:05:08.508 --> 00:05:10.276
who's appeared in a big
fantasy production

00:05:10.276 --> 00:05:11.944
without people
realizing it.

00:05:11.944 --> 00:05:14.814
For example, Stephen Miller
played Voldemort.

00:05:14.814 --> 00:05:16.715
[ Laughter ]

00:05:16.715 --> 00:05:18.918
And might not know this,
but Jeff Sessions

00:05:18.918 --> 00:05:21.154
played the goblin banker
in "Harry Potter."

00:05:21.154 --> 00:05:22.955
[ Laughter ]

00:05:22.955 --> 00:05:25.925
And finally, Melania Trump
was the stunt double

00:05:25.925 --> 00:05:28.460
for David bowie
in "Labyrinth."

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:30.596
I did not realize.
These are things I did not know.

00:05:30.596 --> 00:05:32.231
[ Applause ]

00:05:32.231 --> 00:05:34.333
Oh listen to this, Haagen-Dazs
just announced

00:05:34.333 --> 00:05:38.103
that America's favorite
ice cream flavor of 2020 is...

00:05:38.103 --> 00:05:41.273
[ Drum roll ]

00:05:41.273 --> 00:05:42.608
Vanilla.

00:05:42.608 --> 00:05:44.410
[ Fog horn ]

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:48.547
[ Applause ]

00:05:48.547 --> 00:05:51.049
Yep, the flavor of the year
is vanilla,

00:05:51.049 --> 00:05:54.153
and also Merriam-Webster's
Word of the Year is "the."

00:05:54.153 --> 00:05:56.556
[ Laughter ]

00:05:56.556 --> 00:05:58.757
Finally, here in New York
they had to close

00:05:58.757 --> 00:06:01.327
the Verrazzano Bridge
this week due to high winds.

00:06:01.327 --> 00:06:03.396
This video is pretty crazy.
Check this out.

00:06:03.396 --> 00:06:07.433 line:0%
[ Creaking ]

00:06:13.206 --> 00:06:15.007 line:0%
-Wow. Yeah.

00:06:15.007 --> 00:06:16.642
The woman from Michigan
was like,

00:06:16.642 --> 00:06:18.477
[Slurring]
"Is that what bridges do?

00:06:18.477 --> 00:06:20.479
[ Laughter ]

00:06:20.479 --> 00:06:24.383
Is that what bridges always do?

00:06:24.383 --> 00:06:26.486
Is that what bridges do?

00:06:26.486 --> 00:06:29.288
They go up and down?
Is that what they do?

00:06:29.288 --> 00:06:32.491
Because that one's doing it."

00:06:32.491 --> 00:06:34.259
Driving over it,
your GPS is like,

00:06:34.259 --> 00:06:36.428
"I hope you have your affairs
in order."

00:06:36.428 --> 00:06:38.864
Oh, my goodness. Can you believe
it's already happening?

00:06:38.864 --> 00:06:41.166
This is very exciting.
Guys, we have exactly

00:06:41.166 --> 00:06:44.237
12 shows left before we go
on Christmas break.

00:06:44.237 --> 00:06:47.073
[ Applause ]
Yeah, already.

00:06:47.073 --> 00:06:48.874
Which mean it's time
for that beloved

00:06:48.874 --> 00:06:50.343
