00:07:30.582 --> 00:07:33.252
Ooh. Oh, yes.

00:07:33.252 --> 00:07:35.587
Oh, it's so beautiful --

00:07:35.587 --> 00:07:36.955
Look at this.
Yeah, let's see it.

00:07:36.955 --> 00:07:38.490
Oh!

00:07:38.490 --> 00:07:40.826
Oh, wow.
That's a lot of --

00:07:40.826 --> 00:07:42.628
