00:07:42.628 --> 00:07:45.731
That's unbelievable.
That is a fancy, fancy --

00:07:45.731 --> 00:07:47.466
Ooh, the back!
Look at the back.

00:07:47.466 --> 00:07:49.701
[ Applause ]
This is a one of a kind.

00:07:49.701 --> 00:07:51.270
This is a one of a kind.

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:54.907
Now let's see who's going home
with tonight's sweater.

00:07:54.907 --> 00:07:57.009
Everyone look at your
seat number,

00:07:57.009 --> 00:07:59.578
and if I call your number,
come on down.

00:07:59.578 --> 00:08:01.480
Who wants this sweater, huh?
Come on.

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:03.115
