Come on down.

00:08:15.427 --> 00:08:18.130
Oh, welcome.
Thank you so much.

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:19.431
Please, right over there.

00:08:19.431 --> 00:08:21.567
Oh, my goodness.
Hi, how are you?

00:08:21.567 --> 00:08:22.868
