[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:30.075
Jennifer, it's a little chilly
out there right now.

00:08:30.075 --> 00:08:32.378
Do you have anything like this?
-No, nothing like this.

00:08:32.378 --> 00:08:34.113
-No. Would you like to
