-I can't help you.

00:08:37.215 --> 00:08:38.984
Yeah, go for it. Yep.
Yeah, here you go.

00:08:38.984 --> 00:08:41.319
You can --
[ Applause ]

00:08:41.319 --> 00:08:43.656
This is gonna be --
Trust me, it's gonna go --

00:08:43.656 --> 00:08:46.292
Oh, I can already tell, this is
